  "thresholds": {
    "_comment": "Operator specified: rewrite above 30% AI, land under 10%, accept up to 20%. rewrite_trigger is set to 20 rather than 30 to close a gap that specification leaves open: a document scoring 25% would fail the 20% pass bar while never triggering a rewrite, so it would be marked failed without anyone trying to fix it. Anything above 30 still always rewrites, as specified.",
