    "min_fidelity": 85,
    "min_grammar": 80,
    "min_aeo": 70
  },
  "score_weights": {
    "_comment": "Set from the measured feature table in features.py, not intuition. translationese and grammar carry the signal that separated native Hindi from raw MT; register is weighted low because the calibration fixtures (news + encyclopedia) never address a reader, so it is untested. Re-run calibrate.py after changing any of these.",
